WEBVTT

00:06:57.871 --> 00:07:02.538
right now with feeling freaked
out and exhausted.

00:07:03.246 --> 00:07:07.079
I would like to describe this moment
in my career as fun but muddy,

00:07:07.246 --> 00:07:12.371
exciting and scary. I would like to float
sometimes not the constant swimming,

00:07:12.621 --> 00:07:18.038
to survive to some moments to
exhale would be really nice.

00:07:18.746 --> 00:07:21.413
Hi, this is Megan from Michigan,

00:07:21.704 --> 00:07:28.996
and I would describe this moment in my
career as frustrating and uplifting.

00:07:29.746 --> 00:07:32.079
And I wish I could figure out why